<i>Let me have my way</i>

01:22:21.375 --> 01:22:23.665
<i>Your way is good too</i>

01:22:23.666 --> 01:22:27.957
<i>Let us take a leap of faith</i>

01:22:27.958 --> 01:22:32.000
<i>O friend, now I've found you</i>

01:22:32.208 --> 01:22:36.249
<i>This world will dance on my fingertips</i>

01:22:36.250 --> 01:22:40.541
<i>O friend, for sure</i>

01:22:40.791 --> 01:22:44.958
<i>I'll make the sky fall to the ground</i>

01:22:47.000 --> 01:22:49.915
<i>Do you mind takin' me
